 surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"type":"topic","title":"Interaction_PinchView","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a rounded triangle. A magnification (pinch) gesture feeds the shape’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"), gated by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" paging; releasing settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the nearest state with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at its base scale,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered on the magenta artboard."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}